# EXPECT-SUBSTRING: khong ho tro bien tuple
# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
# `str()` tren bien tuple PHAI bi tu choi luc bien dich.
#
# Truoc khi sua (2026-09-30): bien dich THANH CONG, chay THANH CONG, exit
# code 0 - va `str(t)` tra ve chuoi cua PHAAN TU DAU. `t = (5, 7)` in ra "5",
# con Python in ra "(5, 7)". Mat 7 ma KHONG BAO GI.
#
# Goc: `_infer_dtype` chi tra DTYPE, khong tra shape. TypeAnn cua bien tuple
# mang dtype = kieu cua phan tu DAU ('int'), nen nhanh `if infer_dtype(...) ==
# 'int'` cua `str()` uong no la TvkInt roi goi `TvkInt.Str` - ham doc 4 byte
# DAU TIEN cua struct ValueTuple nen ra phan tu dau. Cung nguyên nhan do,
# `str(list[int])` nem InvalidCastException LUC CHAY.
def run() -> "i32":
    t = (5, 7)
    v = str(t)
    print(v)
    return 0
